# The documentation, which is content rather than source.
#
# Prettier would rewrite every code sample into this application's own style -
# single quotes, no semicolons - while `@vitnode/core`, the plugin generator and
# every other page in the documentation use double quotes and semicolons. A
# reader copying a snippet should get code that looks like the code it is about,
# and `pnpm format` should not be able to change 120 documents by accident.
content/docs
